OL,5,G0232 Assignment
OL,6,     FThree years after suffering this
OL,7,     Fcentury's deadliest flood
OL,8,     Fdisaster, the Libyan city of
OL,9,     FDerna, famous for its fragrant
OL,10,     Fjasmine flowers, has been reborn.
OL,11,     FHow's that been achieved?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FIn 1977, Judy Heumann led a
OL,17,     Fhistoric protest that made
OL,18,     Fdisability discrimination illegal
OL,19,     Fin the US and equality the new
OL,20,     Fstatus quo. Her life story became
OL,21,     Fthe film Being Heumann.
