OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1982, the state of Texas began
OL,7,     Fusing a new method to execute
OL,8,     Fprisoners: lethal injection.
OL,9,     FCharlie Brooks became the first
OL,10,     Fperson to be put to death this
OL,11,     Fway.
